{"name": "Last Breath \u6700\u540e\u7684\u6c14\u606f", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Background Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An unknown fungal spore virus suddenly breaks out, turning the infected into bloodthirsty \"Fungi Corpses\" in their madness. Players take on the role of an ordinary female office worker, fighting against various enemies to find her missing younger sister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"441\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298500/extras/4ac4eba65207a85c200e5f50a5571c09.avif?t=1787892673\" width=\"1189\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dark and horror atmosphere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298500/extras/6cdeffc87d4293affca5eed13d593144.poster.avif?t=1787892673\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298500/extras/6cdeffc87d4293affca5eed13d593144.webm?t=1787892673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298500/extras/6cdeffc87d4293affca5eed13d593144.mp4?t=1787892673\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2.5D side-scrolling shooter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298500/extras/3dd2b0ec3b055638bc6347f1e63f4fd5.poster.avif?t=1787892673\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstati